Cudo Lite adapts ideas from "janitor":

  Project:  janitor (ArshiaEcho/janitor)
  Source:   https://github.com/ArshiaEcho/janitor
  Pinned:   tag v0.2.0, commit a1bfbd6b
  Licence:  MIT

What was adapted
  - The structure of the janitor-device skill: diagnose, then ask, then a reversible fix, then verify.
  - The Windows problem catalog (OEM helper suites, trial antivirus, fake PC optimizers, OneDrive sync churn,
    Teams and Edge background work, Search indexing, driver updaters, Game Bar) and its list of
    things never to touch, reworded and shortened into the way the fix-pc skill reads the report.
  What was dropped: the persona and voice, emoji, the macOS half, the CLAUDE.md audit skill, and any
  commands that delete or edit without a per-step yes.
  The scripts (health report, restore point, registry export, baseline, change log) are original.

